This directory is a staging point, not a source directory.

../prepare-context.sh copies files/web_admin.quest -- the admin panel's in-game
helper -- in here, and stage 2b of ../Dockerfile compiles it with a `qc' built
from the same source tree the game cores are built from.

It is deliberately empty in a fresh checkout: the quest is kept once, next to
the panel it belongs to, and staged rather than duplicated.

If you do not want the helper, delete web_admin.quest from here after staging
and rebuild. The image then ships no extra quest and the panel falls back to
writing items, yang and levels straight into the database -- which is what it
did before this existed. Teleport and Running speed need the helper and will
report that it did not answer.
